 CBErrRec;in
⍝ DemoCallbackErrors: the ⎕TRAP action - report what it sees, wherever the
⍝ error surfaced: ⎕DMX, ⎕DM, how many frames above the DQ caller it runs (errT
⍝ is that caller's ⍴⎕LC) and in which function ("caller" if the DQ caller)
 in←(1+errCaller≡2⊃⎕SI)⊃(2⊃⎕SI)'caller'
 'F1.OUT'eWS'Caption'(errMode,' ',errCase,': EN=',(⍕⎕DMX.EN),' EM=',⎕DMX.EM,' DM=',(⊃⎕DM),' depth=+',(⍕(⍴⎕LC)-errT),' in=',in)
